 "id": "t40_0006",
 "prompt": "In a bustling anime style shipyard dock, the scene is anchored by a massive rusted hull on the left, its metal plates peeling under the sun. A foreman in a yellow hard hat stands center stage, pointing firmly at a blueprint held by an engineer in thick glasses who is looking at the paper with intense focus. To their right, a crane operator in blue overalls sits on a steel beam, watching the activity below with crossed arms. Near the water's edge, a sailor in a striped shirt is handing a coiled rope to a deckhand in muddy boots, who is tying it to a bollard. A brown dog sleeps peacefully next to a stack of wooden crates, oblivious to the chaos. A seagull perches atop a lamppost, preening its feathers while observing the scene. In the background, a welder in a protective mask sparks fly as they work on a pipe, while an apprentice in a gray cap holds a toolbox steady for them. A woman in a red scarf walks briskly past a forklift driven by a man in sunglasses, who is reversing carefully. A cat with white paws hides behind a tire, peeking out at a rat scurrying near a drain. An old man in a tweed coat leans against a railing, smoking a pipe and watching the ships. A young girl in a pink dress chases a bouncing ball near the gangplank, her hair flowing behind her. A security guard in a dark uniform stands rigidly by the gate, checking his watch. A parrot in a cage hangs from a hook, squawking loudly at a passing worker in orange vest. The worker in the orange vest ignores the bird, carrying a ladder across the yard. A bicycle leans against a wall, its basket empty. A coffee cup rests on a barrel, steam rising gently. A clipboard lies on the ground, pages fluttering in the wind. There is no digital screen visible in the scene. There is no modern smartphone being used by any character. There is no clear sky above, only industrial smoke.",
